    Assertion:both-honest-bodies-read,sentence:both honest bodies read the same emoji row — the same transcript folds to the same short authentication string so a clean channel confirms
    Assertion:an-interposed-pub-changes,sentence:an interposed pub changes the row — a relay MITM cannot forge the emoji string because it depends on both endpoint keys so the humans see the mismatch
    Assertion:empty-agrees-with-nothing,sentence:empty agrees with nothing — comparing two empty rows is refused so the confirmation is a genuine match not a vacuous pass
